{% comment %}
  Longeva Book page. Hero + three ways to book + what to expect +
  service category CTAs + FAQ + reassurance band.

  Phone, email and address are read from theme settings so the page
  never drifts from the footer. Booking URL defaults to settings but
  falls back to the contact form so the page never produces a dead
  CTA while Sesami is being provisioned.
{% endcomment %}

{% render 'longeva-brand-fonts' %}
{% render 'longeva-schema-page-breadcrumb' %}

{%- liquid
  assign phone = settings.longeva_phone
  assign email = settings.longeva_email
  assign address = settings.longeva_address | default: 'Unit 1, Chichester Court, Milnrow Road, Rochdale, OL16 1UG'
  assign opening_hours = section.settings.opening_hours
-%}

<script>
  // Citadel brief §04 booking URL params: ?treatment=<slug> sends the
  // user straight to the corresponding treatment page where the Sesami
  // button has the right service-id baked in. Eliminates redundant click.
  (function() {
    try {
      var p = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);
      var t = p.get('treatment');
      if (!t) return;
      var map = {
        'anti-wrinkle': '/pages/anti-wrinkle-injections-manchester',
        'dermal-fillers': '/pages/dermal-fillers-manchester',
        'skin-boosters': '/pages/skin-boosters-manchester',
        'chemical-peels': '/pages/chemical-peels-manchester',
        'microneedling': '/pages/microneedling-manchester',
        'fat-dissolve': '/pages/fat-dissolve-manchester',
        'thread-lifts': '/pages/thread-lift-treatment-manchester',
        'acne-treatment': '/pages/acne-treatment-manchester',
        'rosacea': '/pages/rosacea-treatment-manchester',
        'flu-vaccination': '/pages/flu-vaccination-manchester',
        'travel-health': '/pages/travel-health-consultation-manchester',
        'hpv': '/pages/hpv-vaccination-manchester'
      };
      var target = map[t];
      if (target) {
        window.location.replace(target);
      }
    } catch (e) { /* no-op */ }
  })();
</script>

<section class="longeva-book longeva-page longeva-page--light">
  <div class="longeva-container longeva-book__hero">
    <div class="longeva-book__hero-main">
      <p class="longeva-eyebrow">Book a consultation</p>
      <h1 class="longeva-display longeva-book__title">Speak to a pharmacist today.</h1>
      <p class="longeva-book__lede">
        Same-day appointments are usually available for skin, travel, vaccinations and minor ailments. Choose how you would like to book.
      </p>
    </div>
    <aside class="longeva-book__hero-trust" aria-label="{{ section.settings.hero_trust_aria_label | default: 'What to expect' | escape }}">
      {%- assign trust_pairs = '1|2|3' | split: '|' -%}
      {%- for pair in trust_pairs -%}
        {%- assign label_key = 'hero_trust_' | append: pair | append: '_label' -%}
        {%- assign value_key = 'hero_trust_' | append: pair | append: '_value' -%}
        {%- assign trust_label = section.settings[label_key] -%}
        {%- assign trust_value = section.settings[value_key] -%}
        {%- if trust_label != blank and trust_value != blank -%}
          <div class="longeva-book__hero-trust-row">
            <span class="longeva-book__hero-trust-label">{{ trust_label | escape }}</span>
            <span class="longeva-book__hero-trust-value">{{ trust_value | escape }}</span>
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
      {%- endfor -%}
      {% if opening_hours != blank %}
        <div class="longeva-book__hero-trust-row">
          <span class="longeva-book__hero-trust-label">{{ section.settings.hero_trust_hours_label | default: 'Hours' | escape }}</span>
          <span class="longeva-book__hero-trust-value">{{ opening_hours | newline_to_br }}</span>
        </div>
      {% endif %}
    </aside>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%}
    Removed the mid-page GPhC/MHRA strip 2026-05-05 (Varsha review).
    Regulator IDs already render in the announcement bar AND in the
    footer regulatory disclosure on every page; a third repeat between
    the hero and the booking cards read as banner-blindness ("looks
    insecure rather than reassuring"). Two reassurance chips
    (No account required / Cancel anytime) preserved in-place inside
    the booking-card grid so the trust signal does not vanish.
  {%- endcomment -%}

  <div class="longeva-container longeva-book__grid">
    <h2 class="longeva-book__grid-heading longeva-sr-only">Three ways to book</h2>
    {%- comment -%}
      Reassure row leads with the regulator anchor (GPhC reg) so a mobile
      user lands on a clinical trust signal first, not commodity SaaS
      copy. The two paired reassures stay as the practical lock-in.
      Trust aside is hidden below 900px (commercial signals already
      duplicated upstream); this row keeps the spine visible.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    {%- comment -%}
      Reassure row carries three signals: regulator anchor (clinical),
      practitioner identity (clinical), and operational clarity. The
      operational line restores the cancellation reassurance that a
      private-pay buyer needs without resorting to the SaaS pair
      "No account · Cancel anytime" (DTC commodity tell). "Cancel up to
      24 hours before" mirrors Spire / Bupa cancellation copy.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <p class="longeva-book__grid-reassure" aria-label="Trust and booking reassurance">
      <span class="longeva-book__grid-reassure-anchor">GPhC {{ settings.longeva_gphc_number | default: '9012378' }}</span>
      <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
      <span>Pharmacist-led</span>
      <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
      <span>Same-day where clinically appropriate</span>
      <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
      <span>Cancel up to 24 hours before</span>
    </p>
    <article class="longeva-book__card">
      <span class="longeva-book__icon" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="2" y="4" width="20" height="13" rx="2"/><path d="M8 21h8M12 17v4"/></svg>
      </span>
      <h3 class="longeva-book__card-title">Online</h3>
      <p>Choose a service and share your medical context. A pharmacist confirms a time within the same working day.</p>
      <p class="longeva-book__card-cta">
        <a class="longeva-btn longeva-btn--primary-on-light" href="/pages/services-manchester">Pick a service</a>
      </p>
    </article>

    <article class="longeva-book__card">
      <span class="longeva-book__icon" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72c.13.96.37 1.9.72 2.81a2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45c.91.35 1.85.59 2.81.72A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"/></svg>
      </span>
      <h3 class="longeva-book__card-title">Phone</h3>
      {% if phone != blank %}
        <p>Call the pharmacy during opening hours to speak with the team.</p>
        <p class="longeva-book__card-cta">
          <a class="longeva-btn longeva-btn--primary-on-light" href="tel:{{ phone | replace: ' ', '' | replace: '(', '' | replace: ')', '' | replace: '-', '' }}">{{ phone | escape }}</a>
        </p>
      {% else %}
        <p>We are setting up the phone line. Request a callback now and a pharmacist will ring you.</p>
        <p class="longeva-book__card-cta">
          <a class="longeva-btn longeva-btn--ghost" href="/pages/contact">Request a callback</a>
        </p>
      {% endif %}
    </article>

    <article class="longeva-book__card">
      <span class="longeva-book__icon" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg>
      </span>
      <h3 class="longeva-book__card-title">In person</h3>
      <p>{{ address | escape }}</p>
      {% if opening_hours != blank %}
        <p class="longeva-book__hours">{{ opening_hours | newline_to_br }}</p>
      {% endif %}
      <p class="longeva-book__card-cta">
        <a class="longeva-btn longeva-btn--ghost" href="https://maps.google.com/?q={{ address | url_encode }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Get directions</a>
      </p>
    </article>
  </div>

  <div class="longeva-book__steps">
    <div class="longeva-container">
      <h2 class="longeva-display longeva-book__steps-heading">What to expect</h2>
      <ol class="longeva-book__steps-list" role="list">
        <li>
          <span class="longeva-book__step-num">01</span>
          <h3>Choose a service</h3>
          <p>Select from skin, travel, vaccinations, minor ailments or weight management. Not sure? Request a ten-minute triage call.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="longeva-book__step-num">02</span>
          <h3>Brief health check</h3>
          <p>We ask a short set of questions so the pharmacist can assess suitability before you arrive.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="longeva-book__step-num">03</span>
          <h3>{{ section.settings.step_3_heading | default: 'Consultation' | escape }}</h3>
          <p>{{ section.settings.step_3_body | default: 'A GPhC-registered pharmacist reviews your history, explains options and answers your questions before any treatment.' | escape }}</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <span class="longeva-book__step-num">04</span>
          <h3>Treatment and follow-up</h3>
          <p>Treatment delivered by trained clinicians with written aftercare guidance and a follow-up where clinically appropriate.</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="longeva-container longeva-book__cats">
    <h2 class="longeva-display longeva-book__cats-heading">Or jump straight to a service</h2>
    <ul class="longeva-book__cats-list" role="list">
      <li><a href="/pages/aesthetics-manchester"><span>Aesthetics</span>{% render 'longeva-arrow' %}</a></li>
      <li><a href="/pages/skin-health-manchester"><span>Skin health</span>{% render 'longeva-arrow' %}</a></li>
      <li><a href="/pages/travel-health-consultation-manchester"><span>Travel health</span>{% render 'longeva-arrow' %}</a></li>
      <li><a href="/pages/weight-management-manchester"><span>Weight management</span>{% render 'longeva-arrow' %}</a></li>
      <li><a href="/pages/vaccinations-manchester"><span>Vaccinations</span>{% render 'longeva-arrow' %}</a></li>
      <li><a href="/pages/minor-ailments-manchester"><span>Minor ailments</span>{% render 'longeva-arrow' %}</a></li>
      <li><a href="/pages/sexual-health-manchester"><span>Sexual health</span>{% render 'longeva-arrow' %}</a></li>
      <li><a href="/pages/services-manchester"><span>All services</span>{% render 'longeva-arrow' %}</a></li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <div class="longeva-container longeva-book__faq">
    <h2 class="longeva-display longeva-book__faq-heading">Frequently asked questions</h2>
    <details class="longeva-book__faq-item">
      <summary>Do I need a GP referral?</summary>
      <p>No. Longeva is a private clinic. You can book directly. For some services we will ask about any GP-prescribed medicines or recent investigations to keep the assessment safe.</p>
    </details>
    <details class="longeva-book__faq-item">
      <summary>How soon can I be seen?</summary>
      <p>Same-day appointments are usually available for most services where clinically appropriate. For more involved assessments we offer a time within a working day.</p>
    </details>
    <details class="longeva-book__faq-item">
      <summary>What does a consultation cost?</summary>
      <p>Consultation fees vary by service and are shown on each service page. If a treatment is not clinically appropriate for you, we will say so and will not take payment for onward treatment.</p>
    </details>
    <details class="longeva-book__faq-item">
      <summary>Is my information confidential?</summary>
      <p>Yes. Clinical records are held under GPhC professional standards and UK GDPR. See our privacy policy for detail on data retention and your rights.</p>
    </details>
    <script type="application/ld+json">
      {
        "@context": "https://schema.org",
        "@type": "FAQPage",
        "mainEntity": [
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "Do I need a GP referral?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "No. Longeva is a private clinic. You can book directly. For some services we will ask about any GP-prescribed medicines or recent investigations to keep the assessment safe."
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "How soon can I be seen?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "Same-day appointments are usually available for most services where clinically appropriate. For more involved assessments we offer a time within a working day."
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "What does a consultation cost?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "Consultation fees vary by service and are shown on each service page. If a treatment is not clinically appropriate for you, we will say so and will not take payment for onward treatment."
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "Is my information confidential?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "Yes. Clinical records are held under GPhC professional standards and UK GDPR. See our privacy policy for detail on data retention and your rights."
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    </script>
  </div>
</section>

{% stylesheet %}
  .longeva-book { padding-block: 0; }
  /* Hero compressed 2026-05-05 (Varsha review): the three booking cards
     must be visible at the mobile eye line on first paint without the
     user scrolling. Top padding shrunk and bottom padding tightened
     against the card grid, so on a typical 375x667 device the Online
     card sits within the first viewport. Desktop breathing room
     preserved through clamp upper bounds. */
  .longeva-book__hero {
    padding-block: clamp(40px, 6vw, 88px) clamp(20px, 3vw, 32px);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 360px);
    gap: clamp(24px, 4vw, 56px);
    align-items: start;
  }
  .longeva-book__hero-main {
    max-width: 640px;
  }
  .longeva-book__title {
    font-size: clamp(28px, 4.4vw, 48px);
    margin: 12px 0 0;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }
  .longeva-book__lede {
    font-family: var(--longeva-font-body);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--longeva-text-subdued);
    margin: 16px 0 0;
    max-width: 56ch;
  }
  .longeva-book__hero-trust {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    border-radius: var(--longeva-radius-card);
    padding: 24px 28px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 14px;
  }
  .longeva-book__hero-trust-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 80px 1fr;
    gap: 12px;
    align-items: baseline;
    font-family: var(--longeva-font-body);
    line-height: 1.45;
    padding-block-end: 12px;
    border-block-end: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
  }
  .longeva-book__hero-trust-row:last-child {
    border-block-end: 0;
    padding-block-end: 0;
  }
  .longeva-book__hero-trust-label {
    color: rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.66);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .longeva-book__hero-trust-value {
    color: #1A1A1A;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .longeva-book__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
    padding-block: clamp(12px, 2vw, 28px) clamp(28px, 4vw, 48px);
  }
  .longeva-book__grid-reassure {
    grid-column: 1 / -1;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 0 14px;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
    padding: 0;
    font-family: var(--longeva-font-body);
    font-size: 13px;
    color: rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.62);
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
  }
  .longeva-book__grid-reassure span[aria-hidden="true"] {
    color: rgba(26, 26, 26, 0.30);
  }
  .longeva-book__grid-reassure-anchor {
    color: var(--longeva-primary);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-size: 11px;
  }
  .longeva-book__card {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 1px solid var(--longeva-border);
    border-radius: var(--longeva-radius-card);
    padding: 28px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    min-height: 240px;
  }
  .longeva-book__icon {
    width: 44px;
    height: 44px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: rgba(185, 145, 87, 0.14);
    border: 1px solid rgba(185, 145, 87, 0.30);
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: #2D190E;
    margin-block-end: 14px;
  }
  .longeva-book__card-title {
    font-family: var(--longeva-font-display);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 24px;
    margin: 12px 0 8px;
    color: var(--longeva-text);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
  .longeva-book__card p {
    font-family: var(--longeva-font-body);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--longeva-text);
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }
  .longeva-book__card .longeva-book__hours {
    color: var(--longeva-text-subdued);
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .longeva-book__card .longeva-book__card-cta {
    margin: auto 0 0;
  }
  .longeva-book__steps {
    background: var(--longeva-primary);
    color: var(--longeva-primary-ivory);
    padding-block: clamp(56px, 7vw, 88px);
  }
  .longeva-book__steps-heading {
    font-size: clamp(28px, 3.5vw, 40px);
    color: var(--longeva-primary-ivory);
    margin: 0 0 40px;
  }
  .longeva-book__steps-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 24px;
  }
  .longeva-book__steps-list li {
    border-block-start: 1px solid rgba(245, 241, 234, 0.20);
    padding-block-start: 16px;
  }
  .longeva-book__step-num {
    display: block;
    font-family: var(--longeva-font-body);
    font-size: 13px;
    color: rgba(245, 241, 234, 0.60);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }
  .longeva-book__steps-list h3 {
    font-family: var(--longeva-font-display);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 20px;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--longeva-primary-ivory);
    margin: 12px 0 8px;
  }
  .longeva-book__steps-list p {
    font-family: var(--longeva-font-body);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: rgba(245, 241, 234, 0.80);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .longeva-book__cats {
    padding-block: clamp(40px, 6vw, 72px);
  }
  .longeva-book__cats-heading {
    font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 32px);
    margin: 0 0 24px;
  }
  .longeva-book__cats-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 1px;
    background: var(--longeva-border);
    border: 1px solid var(--longeva-border);
    border-radius: var(--longeva-radius-card);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .longeva-book__cats-list a {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    background: var(--longeva-bg);
    padding: 20px 24px;
    font-family: var(--longeva-font-body);
    font-size: 16px;
    color: var(--longeva-text);
    text-decoration: none;
    min-height: 56px;
    transition: background 0.15s var(--longeva-ease), color 0.15s var(--longeva-ease);
  }
  .longeva-book__cats-list a:hover,
  .longeva-book__cats-list a:focus-visible {
    background: var(--longeva-primary);
    color: var(--longeva-primary-ivory);
    outline: none;
  }
  .longeva-book__faq {
    padding-block: clamp(40px, 6vw, 72px);
    max-width: 880px;
  }
  .longeva-book__faq-heading {
    font-size: clamp(24px, 3vw, 32px);
    margin: 0 0 24px;
  }
  .longeva-book__faq-item {
    border-block-start: 1px solid var(--longeva-border);
    padding-block: 18px;
  }
  .longeva-book__faq-item:last-child {
    border-block-end: 1px solid var(--longeva-border);
  }
  .longeva-book__faq-item summary {
    list-style: none;
    cursor: pointer;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 24px;
    font-family: var(--longeva-font-body);
    font-size: 17px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--longeva-text);
  }
  .longeva-book__faq-item summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }
  .longeva-book__faq-item summary::after {
    content: '+';
    font-size: 22px;
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--longeva-primary);
    transition: transform 0.2s var(--longeva-ease);
  }
  .longeva-book__faq-item[open] summary::after { content: '\2212'; }
  .longeva-book__faq-item p {
    font-family: var(--longeva-font-body);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--longeva-text);
    margin: 12px 0 0;
    max-width: 64ch;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .longeva-book__hero {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 12px;
      padding-block: 28px 12px;
    }
    /* Trust aside hidden on mobile (Varsha review 2026-05-05): every row
       on it is already surfaced upstream (announcement bar carries GPhC,
       lede carries "same-day", cards carry response/clinician). Hiding
       it lets the three booking cards reach the eye line on first paint
       on a 375x667 device. Visible on >=900px where there is no fold
       penalty. */
    .longeva-book__hero-trust {
      display: none;
    }
    .longeva-book__grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; padding-block: 8px 28px; }
    .longeva-book__steps-list { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .longeva-book__cats-list { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .longeva-book__hero { padding-block: 22px 12px; }
    .longeva-book__title { font-size: clamp(24px, 6vw, 32px); }
    .longeva-book__lede { font-size: 15px; margin-top: 12px; }
    .longeva-book__card { padding: 22px; min-height: 0; }
    .longeva-book__steps-list { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .longeva-book__cats-list { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    /* Narrow viewport: stack the reassure chips vertically so the GPhC
       anchor never orphans on its own line above wrapped text. Hide
       the inline middot separators since the line break replaces them. */
    .longeva-book__grid-reassure {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 4px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .longeva-book__grid-reassure span[aria-hidden="true"] { display: none; }
  }
{% endstylesheet %}

